$ 26016 Concourse viewing platform - WinGRAF pictures of model v19m (v19 + MZ released at the 18 L1 r 8.5 ring ends of the A/B joints) for the design report (same views as v15 W1 to W4, plus W8 external stair)
$ Reads 26016_v19m_copy.cdb, a COPY of 26016_check_v19m.cdb (run 13 Nov 2026). The original v19m database is not opened.
$ Pictures go to this project's .plb; PLBCONVERTER then saves them as PNG files in the folder wing_img.

+PROG WING urs:1
HEAD 26016 Concourse viewing platform - model v19m
DB 1 TITL '26016_v19m_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ

$ img_0 = W1: 3D model with rendered cross sections (external stair at the right front)
STRU NUME SSTR NUMN BEAM FILL VARC REPR DSTR

$ img_1 = W2: deformed shape, SLS characteristic G + Q (LC 201), magnified
LC 201
DEFO TYPE YES FAC 100 LC CURR
STRU NUME FULL
DEFO NO
END

+PROG WING urs:2
HEAD 26016 Level 2 framing (group 25) - bending moment My, ULS LC 119
DB 1 TITL '26016_v19m_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 25
$ img_2 = W3: Level 2 beams, My under LC 119
LC 119
BEAM TYPE MY SCHH YES
END

+PROG WING urs:3
HEAD 26016 buckling mode 1 of PLC 102 - ground floor facade diagonals (group 11)
DB 1 TITL '26016_v19m_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 11
$ img_3 = W4: buckling mode 1 (LC 9201), magnified
LC 9201
DEFO TYPE YES FAC 40 LC CURR
STRU NUME FULL
DEFO NO
END

+PROG WING urs:4
HEAD 26016 external stair ground to Level 1 (group 62) - cross sections to scale
DB 1 TITL '26016_v19m_copy.cdb'
SIZE TYPE URS SC 0
VIEW TYPE DIRE X -1 Y 0.35 Z -0.45 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 62
$ img_4 = W8: close view of the external stair, sections to scale, viewed from outside the platform
STRU NUME SSTR NUMN BEAM FILL VARC REPR DSTR
END

+PROG PLBCONVERTER urs:9
HEAD export the WinGRAF pictures as PNG
IMG FNR 'wing_img/img_%number%.%ext%' OVRT YES FMT PNG
END


